      "title": "[guillaumemeigniez.me] Japanese Postcards",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=guillaumemeigniez.me&amp;sz=128\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\nAlong my trip across Japan I collected a bunch of postcards from places I visited. I got them in museums, in tourist shops or in second-hand bookstores. I sent some to friends and family, but most of them I kept as souvenirs for this year of travelling. I built a small website to showcase them in an interactive way organized by category. Very cool cities Osaka, Nagasaki, Kobe, Sapporo, Aomori, Fukushima... Favorite activity this year: hiking Mount Rokko (六甲山) &amp; Mount Hiei (比叡山) in the Kyoto region, Mount Ni",
